+#if defined(ARM64_BOARD_CONFIG_SWEET)
+/*
+ * Wi-Fi port 0136 (sweetquiesce=1; DC28088 0138 had this unconditionally). SWEET: no IOKit daemon
+ * ever reports that it has launched (no kexts to manage), so the busy hold below keeps the registry
+ * root busy forever: IOKit never quiesces, configd's InterfaceNamer never says "quiet" (it gives up
